# Tasks: Production-Ready Monetization (Stripe & Fulfillment)

Transitioning SkillPilot from mock simulations to a real-world commerce platform.

## Phase I: Polymorphic Commerce Foundation
- [ ] Migrate `order_items` table to support polymorphic `itemable_id/type`
- [ ] Update `Order` and `OrderItem` models for polymorphic relationships
- [ ] Refactor `OrderController.php` to handle generic item types (Course, Bundle, Membership)

## Phase II: Fulfillment Engine
- [ ] Create `FulfillmentService.php` to handle access grants
- [ ] Implement Bundle fulfillment (create `BundlePurchase`)
- [ ] Implement Membership fulfillment (update `Subscription` and User Tier)
- [ ] Implement Course fulfillment (Direct enrollment)

## Phase III: Stripe Integration
- [ ] Install `stripe/stripe-php`
- [ ] Implement `StripeController.php` for Checkout Sessions
- [ ] Implement Stripe Webhook handler
- [ ] Add Stripe API keys to `.env` (Mock/Test keys)

## Phase IV: Frontend Checkout UX
- [ ] Create `checkout/page.tsx` with order summary
- [ ] Integrate "Pay with Stripe" button
- [ ] Verify Redirect and Success/Cancel flows

## Phase V: Verification
- [ ] Run `FulfillmentTest.php`
- [ ] Manual end-to-end purchase verification
